{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d16ef05ffabd065b33c92123013ac7c9568502d894c0a3fea5d48e6fc886d588", "ja": "（今度、春香と千早が出演する新作ミュージカル。\nその、アンサンブルのオーディション募集が届いた）", "zh": "（春香和千早下次要出演的新音乐剧，送来了那部剧的群演招募通知。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4325e761b34acaa6505a7ee98fb59c588f96ddab8e089a9def51a1ef38430cea", "ja": "アンサンブルか……難しい仕事だけど、\n誰か挑戦してみたいアイドルはいるかな……。", "zh": "群演啊……虽然是份困难的工作，有没有哪位偶像想挑战一下呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "f426fe09afde511eef137f16010c76507f39503f08f37c91cc867b6e411955e0", "ja": "楽しみだな～♪　たっぷり見るぞミュージカル～♪　\nきっとすごいぞワンダフル～♪　えへっ。", "zh": "好期待啊～♪　要好好欣赏这场音乐剧～♪  \n一定很精彩，太棒啦～♪　嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_1004", "source_sha256": "9da2297d69602ad80cd05adae68a10af696631a94e2e42f296953ea902c6368a", "ja": "可奈！", "zh": "可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2000_p", "source_sha256": "639421a4cef2c70d8a7af78fe86189d57a1159e7aff691de96150679d9ab0347", "ja": "可奈、お疲れ様！", "zh": "可奈，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2001_036kan", "source_sha256": "a46680a98d92285b934cd7729e0e7ef689c33b79d12b7bcc3f16f0daae229e31", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。お疲れさまです！\n実は今朝、うれしいことがあって♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。辛苦了！\n其实今天早上遇到了一件开心的事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2002_p", "source_sha256": "01d6386c5b0c701c973d70ac58d1411b56a23bf1f6e520f261712b2b70100e1f", "ja": "嬉しいこと？", "zh": "令人开心的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2003_036kan", "source_sha256": "a63bed61add4893b0dce58ffd8e0cd8ad3a643db44a41b730f3d86299a5b5f0d", "ja": "はい！　今度、ミュージカルがありますよね？\n春香さんと千早さんが出演する！", "zh": "是的！下次不是有音乐剧吗？\n春香和千早会出演的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2004_036kan", "source_sha256": "4acebb1819119ac7fd3134a6bfec059f9b1350b9bebbd6fb144a4817e377bcb2", "ja": "私、どうしてもその公演が見たくて……お母さんに\n頼んで、チケットを取ってもらうことにしたんです！", "zh": "我实在太想看那场演出了……所以拜托妈妈帮我买票了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2005_036kan", "source_sha256": "381b4e34253a3204614e952b46ba2e9f0b601c6fd3af38bb42eae3a71a425e14", "ja": "その代わり、お小遣いはすこし減っちゃいますけど。\nでもでも、うれしいので問題ナシで～す♪", "zh": "不过这样一来，零花钱就要少一点了。\n但是但是，因为我很开心，所以完全没问题～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2006_p", "source_sha256": "71eb3d4ce1ced9130ed22a915f58c40969e7eaf49493bf25a82b3a801a7d38c2", "ja": "そうだったのか。そんなに見たかったなら、\n事務所でチケットを手配することもできたけど……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。要是你那么想看的话，\n我也可以在事务所帮你安排票的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2007_036kan", "source_sha256": "1b464bae921a26f93071f98154bbd41b3ab0c2ac3b9a01e5f12fae5d9b996e54", "ja": "……あ、そっか！　{$P$}さんに\nお願いするっていう方法もあったんだ！", "zh": "……啊，对哦！原来还可以拜托{$P$}先生帮忙弄票！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2008_036kan", "source_sha256": "7a5403d13a2507ee29556c3dbbbb64482ec58df378455e7005213c4be132f675", "ja": "ん～……でも、大丈夫です！　自分が見たい公演だし、\nやっぱり自分のお金で、ちゃんとチケットを取ります！", "zh": "嗯～……不过，没关系！毕竟是我自己想看的演出，还是用自己的钱好好把票买下来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2009_p", "source_sha256": "0c43b5933fcb09e1b8cec3e7a7ce4cce3dfd4e23886faf32a629e7bf6eac8448", "ja": "そうか。というか、聞いておきたいんだけど……\n可奈は、ミュージカルに興味があるんだよな？", "zh": "这样啊。话说，我想先确认一下……\n可奈对音乐剧感兴趣，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2010_036kan", "source_sha256": "cc75d61cd5731f35cdff4a49df183090b77e987a593ac795895e16767b777731", "ja": "はい♪　前から思ってたんです。ミュージカルって、\nもしかして私にピッタリなんじゃないかな～って！", "zh": "是呀♪我之前就一直在想，音乐剧说不定真的很适合我呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2011_036kan", "source_sha256": "d32ee640eabfc8687855be6f614bb29987c1b29409856b779622f40c7e17f201", "ja": "お話の途中で歌い出しちゃうところとか……\nすっごく私向きなお仕事かもしれませんよね！？", "zh": "比如聊着聊着就唱起来这一点……\n说不定真的是特别适合我的工作呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2012_p", "source_sha256": "c5e34edbabc1d442f453edfa78646fe8af92cb069c83ac6fe77e536a4513497c", "ja": "可奈は歌うのが大好きだもんな。それに演技の仕事も、\nいくつかこなしてきているし……うん。", "zh": "可奈很喜欢唱歌嘛。而且演戏的工作，\n你也接过好几份了……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2013_036kan", "source_sha256": "2ed21ae4d714b02233c2f6161ab1aae554bcb2cfdffc5b610965f877ece670f8", "ja": "そうなんです♪　私、歌はずっと大好きなんですけど。\n最近はお芝居も楽しいな～って思えてきて！", "zh": "就是这样♪我一直都很喜欢唱歌，不过最近也开始觉得演戏很开心了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2014_036kan", "source_sha256": "276247ef75a507ac344093156643716efa94337e3fd1f4293c068ad21c9dd8eb", "ja": "だから前に志保ちゃんがミュージカルに出た時は、\n「うらやましいな～」って思ったりしてました。えへ♪", "zh": "所以之前志保出演音乐剧的时候，\n我还想着“真羡慕啊～”之类的。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2015_p", "source_sha256": "fe64b257bf0d6e21996b66ccd76740be3a0565428f216ec4a0fb493828c0e061", "ja": "そうか。ならやっぱり、\nこの話はちょうどよかったかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊。那看来，这件事还真是正合适呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2016_036kan", "source_sha256": "8fa529ad41882d556c3763933fb2265a60db7a16c8d866d4d4c062a60961a237", "ja": "？　なんの話ですか？", "zh": "？是什么话题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2017_p", "source_sha256": "f3428ad8380f2284e4fa2f9f70d91dea8142e3d2771507c5037d0d20aa58a0fa", "ja": "実は、その春香たちが出演するミュージカルの、\nアンサンブルを選ぶオーディションがあるんだ。", "zh": "其实，春香她们参演的那部音乐剧，\n有一场选拔群演阵容的试镜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2018_p", "source_sha256": "2f19555ea41a7ec83948ddf81f311039f16fba64e2c96cfc664710bbf1d81b84", "ja": "うちの劇場からも、何人か参加してもらおうと\n思っているんだけど……可奈、挑戦してみないか？", "zh": "我想让咱们剧场也出几个人去参加……可奈，你愿意挑战一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2019_036kan", "source_sha256": "9e2982a90bebe57032596a6e0fed8933c4d5516ec7c0ce5c647a986dc93ccc0c", "ja": "……え？　ええっ！？\nわ、私がですか～！！？", "zh": "……诶？诶诶！？\n我、我吗～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2020_p", "source_sha256": "a82ab15bc65bf470dab98acb9735df591551f131d5157f0636f8c81c6dd87a2f", "ja": "ああ。せっかくの機会だしな。ミュージカルに\n興味があるなら、チャレンジする意味はあると思う！", "zh": "是啊。难得有这样的机会嘛。如果你对音乐剧感兴趣，我觉得值得挑战一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2021_036kan", "source_sha256": "cb9502e48111ec3be3fa565309838468d9486d944c466a449f13817014e8f7a1", "ja": "た、たしかに、そうですよね。\nう～ん、う～ん……。どうしよう……。", "zh": "确、确实是这样呢。\n唔～唔～……怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2022_p", "source_sha256": "842fea6ccb9572e731e5f7724f8eecc02109dee67c841fb2e58b19f979e35aaa", "ja": "もちろん、無理にとは言わない。\n役名のある春香たちと違って、アンサンブルだしな。", "zh": "当然，我也不会勉强你。\n和有角色名的春香她们不同，你演的是群演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2023_p", "source_sha256": "0013778f7e6b467f4cf7cb3cc671170715dbca79c6eb021c5ca6c19a4e8ea226", "ja": "ただアンサンブルは、ステージを支える役割でもある。\nもちろん、今回は見るだけでも……。", "zh": "不过，群演也有支撑舞台的作用。\n当然，这次就算只是旁观也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2024_036kan", "source_sha256": "ce4fa23c127340804a97b2ea345a3e6521993080af6fb6c4580e155fce25df2d", "ja": "……い、いえっ！　やります、やらせてください！\nせっかくの、ち、チャンスですからっ！", "zh": "……不、不用了！我要参加，请让我参加吧！\n这可是难得的、机、机会啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2025_036kan", "source_sha256": "5babb60e4f62fb3b62eb70f6f211d682dcdf2453ff1dcf09c1d1d55b39d03dac", "ja": "私、合格できるかはわからないですけど……\nでも、挑戦してみたいです！", "zh": "我不知道自己能不能合格……\n但是，我想试着挑战一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2026_p", "source_sha256": "2c0dff7ab09903681da9a955ada198b591cddead92fed215b1cea7fa23f09d45", "ja": "わかった！\nなら、可奈の名前もエントリーしておくよ。", "zh": "明白了！\n那我也会帮你报名的，可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2027_p", "source_sha256": "711e937f2a8d3ff55684a14af732734b3c9c46b4e264614fa6d7a06d260e38e0", "ja": "やると決まったら、合格できるよう頑張ろう。\n精いっぱいサポートするからな！", "zh": "既然决定要参加，那就努力争取合格吧。\n我会竭尽全力支持你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2028_036kan", "source_sha256": "bcb8a4f8f859c355bb1e9020714360507a167f8fb5962d52efcdefda1f25f19c", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nはいっ、ありがとうございます！　よ、よ～し！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n好的，谢谢你！那、那就加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2029_036kan", "source_sha256": "d4afc251f0c9e2e947715937af0d20dc508f89bedd361d2fdf028d4d68ee87e1", "ja": "アンサンブルで、合格するぞ～♪\nレッスンいっぱいがんばるぞ～♪　お～！", "zh": "一定要通过合奏考核～♪\n接下来要努力进行好多训练～♪　噢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2030_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2031_p", "source_sha256": "2277f6dd71b45f46074f04631cbc544f81bee9adc2e7bad4d2d7f66dc4f21a6f", "ja": "（アンサンブルオーディション当日。最終的に、\n可奈、麗花、恵美の3人が参加することとなった！）", "zh": "（合奏试镜当天。最终，决定由可奈、丽花、惠美这3人参加！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2032_020meg", "source_sha256": "e656ee51d6d513cd2df87bdcc17ffec5b2cdb5ba272393a1f968f732a6a36d91", "ja": "見事にバラけたね～。中学生、高校生、大学生……。\n{$P$}、もしかしてそれ狙った感じ？", "zh": "分得还挺均匀的嘛～。初中生、高中生、大学生……。{$P$}，该不会是故意这样安排的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2033_p", "source_sha256": "84e0c2706cf2c2056f8ae64802cfa751eb1e6a0edc66c4943b00ebee70b74672", "ja": "その通りだ！　後は、\n個性も被らないように意識したかな。", "zh": "正是如此！另外，我也有意识地避免让大家的个性重叠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2034_036kan", "source_sha256": "f8da82e7243987e987226d8ff4025c6f373ae3e972b5639f25477825241d8d0c", "ja": "すうぅ～……はあぁ～……。すうぅ～……。\n……ううっ。だ、ダメだ～、全然落ち着かない～！", "zh": "吸气～～……呼气～～……吸气～～……。\n……呜呜。不、不行～，完全冷静不下来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2035_048rei", "source_sha256": "dbc3a042a53d3a011954985c221c538f0d92d718d4e27d1f8125f9d28ff80b17", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、大丈夫？　ほらほら、手を貸して！\n緊張緊張～、お空に飛んでけ～。ププイのプイッ♪", "zh": "可奈，没事吧？来来来，搭把手！\n紧张紧张～飞到天上去吧～噗噗一挥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2036_020meg", "source_sha256": "1a755961706b81864d98f02b7c46e555a742f7e8b194f2a84726114b3bbbac3a", "ja": "可奈、ずいぶん緊張してるね？　なんか可奈を\n見てたら、アタシは逆に落ち着いてきちゃったよ。", "zh": "可奈，你还真是相当紧张啊？看着可奈，\n我反而渐渐冷静下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2037_036kan", "source_sha256": "a21370ddc96e7e3146c809af7a051ce727ea1affbaef0116b3cb8dcd72193255", "ja": "そ、そんなぁ、恵美さ～ん！\n私のこと、置いていかないでくださ～い！", "zh": "没、没那样啦，惠美——！\n请不要丢下我呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2038_p", "source_sha256": "e3175af7e6e3ae84faa35801510effef7dcbccfd4a0f9e8d84d73725f75ca397", "ja": "今回、オーディション自体は難しくないそうだ。\n見込みのある人間は、全員合格させると聞いてる。", "zh": "听说这次试镜本身并不难。\n有潜力的人，都会通过选拔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2039_p", "source_sha256": "44af0904b19ef5a305c7a797a0f230fec57429df0c2a5e0a41d12e9b47095a4f", "ja": "厳しいのは、むしろその後の……おっ。\nみんな、そろそろ始まるみたいだぞ。", "zh": "真正严格的，反而是之后的……哦，大家好像快要开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2040_staff", "source_sha256": "4f5f05a6bd8b22252071a5d3c9f248fa93c3e5b8643206c2f2be40c9b3b93b0f", "ja": "それでは、これよりオーディションを開始します！\n番号を呼ばれた方から、順番に集まってください。", "zh": "那么，接下来开始试镜！\n请被叫到号码的人按顺序集合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2041_036kan", "source_sha256": "7be37c4ee0f81d4fde0b6a43e7c9dbee89a78cd45673385c7565920806983239", "ja": "ひゃ、ひゃいっ！", "zh": "呀、呀！蕙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2042_p", "source_sha256": "129727beaec5b9351740a2c3df1a9651423cf369cbd12bb15ca2cec56b3af8b3", "ja": "（……オーディションより厳しいのは、むしろこの後。\nアンサンブル全員で行われる、合同レッスンだ）", "zh": "（……比试镜更严格的，反而是接下来要进行的。\n那就是全体合奏成员一起参加的联合练习）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2043_p", "source_sha256": "3602e0e66a85c66e7f286a88d804ac17b2e3b628103257a03aeb148665cf8b80", "ja": "（合格しても、レッスンで上位にならなければアンダー\n……控えになり、本番の舞台に立つ事はできない）", "zh": "（就算通过了选拔，如果在训练中拿不到前列，也会成为候补……也就是替补，无法登上正式演出的舞台）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_111_2044_036kan", "source_sha256": "42657507e948903f282ee000003444bfa4bff8009ebee2b8321c43994197d676", "ja": "{$P$}さぁん！\nご、合格しました～！！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n我、我合格了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
